	(property "Description" "Base 0.28 ohm 1% 0.5W current shunt, unchanged for both batteries. Thermal option adds R56 upstream. CN3722 CSP senses upstream of R56, BAT downstream of R1; Kelvin connections. Cold ~96mA; warm ~665mA with three parallel AO3401A; bypass/no thermal nominal 714mA."
